    "markersVersion": 1,
    "_comment": "Source-contract markers (#2524): named strings a change asserts must be present in the COMPILED admin bundle. bin/build-admin-dist refuses to publish a bundle that does not satisfy every marker, and bin/admin-dist-acceptance verify re-checks them against the committed tree, so a feature can never ship in packages/admin/app while being absent from the served bytes. Add a marker in the same PR that adds the feature; every string AdminDistContentTest asserts against the served bundle must be declared here (AdminDistCanonicalOperationTest derives that list from the test source, so the two cannot become competing vocabularies); changing a marker's value without a rebuild turns the gate red. Scopes: bundle-js (all dist/**/*.js), stylesheet (all dist/**/*.css), published-path (a file that must exist under dist/).",
